    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Hey, you're not a bad guy. You just want something, and you're going to get it, right? Here's your gun, here's your knife, and nobody needs to get hurt if you pay attention. You're cool. You have it all under control. Maybe you're as funny, as witty and as cool as you think you are. Probably not. Who's going to argue, hey?</p><h2>Stat Block (as printed)</h2><p><strong>Nature:</strong> Bravo<br><strong>Demeanor:</strong> Bravo</p><p><strong>Physical (10):</strong> Brawny x2, Brutal x3, Quick x2, Tough x2<br><strong>Social (5):</strong> Intimidating x5, Callous (N)<br><strong>Mental (3):</strong> Determined x2, Reflective, Violent (N)</p><p><strong>Abilities:</strong> Brawl 2, Dodge 2, Firearms 2, Streetwise 2</p><p><strong>Backgrounds:</strong> Influence: Underworld x1, Resources x1<br><strong>Virtues:</strong> Conscience 3, Self-Control 3, Courage 4<br><strong>Path:</strong> Humanity 3<br><strong>Willpower:</strong> 2</p>",
